Test that the audio processing follows the muted state of every channel

The voice engine with WebRTC's patch 0008, two send channels on a fake call and a mock
audio processing: one channel's stream muted or let go of while another's sends leaves
the output in use; muted only once nothing sends. Built in again with the media
engine, its fakes and mocks: the library shows only its own API.

